# The same keystrokes through `yi tui --headless` and `yi console --headless`: a prompt,
# the faux reply, the `/` popup and its dismissal. The frames both runs must show are the
# executable form of "the pane is solo's chat".
wait-frame 8000 faux-1
type hello parity
key enter
wait-frame 15000 faux:
wait-idle 15000
type /
wait-frame 3000 plantree
key esc
wait-frame 3000 !plantree
wait 200
quit
